[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0650","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0650.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0886","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 Web Server 文件请求解析远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 存在可执行文件解析漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的畸形请求，在可执行文件名后附加操作系统命令，导致服务器解析并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求构造恶意 URI 触发该漏洞，实现远程命令执行，进而控制目标服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0886"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0，微软已在 2000 年发布安全公告 MS00-086 提供补丁。建议立即安装对应补丁，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中禁用可执行文件映射中的 .exe 扩展名处理作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1912","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?mid=143604&list=1&fromthread=0&end=2000-11-11&threads=0&start=2000-11-05&","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-086","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5470","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A191","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20384","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0886.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0886","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0886.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2000/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0886.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0886.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0650.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0649","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0649.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0884","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 Unicode编码目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 及 Personal Web Server (PWS) 存在 Unicode 编码目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含特殊 Unicode 编码字符（如 %c1%1c）的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过 IIS 的路径安全检查，读取 Web 根目录以外的任意文件，甚至可能执行任意命令。该漏洞源于 IIS 对 Unicode 编码 URL 的解析缺陷，将编码序列错误解释为目录遍历符，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 IIS 4.0/5.0 及 PWS 等版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0884"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-078 对应补丁（IIS 4.0 更新 Q277625，IIS 5.0 更新 Q277625），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。如无法打补丁，在 IIS 管理器中禁用「父路径」选项，并删除可执行虚拟目录的脚本映射权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/436","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1806","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-078","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5377","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A44","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/190","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0884.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0884.json","https://github.com/swiftlang/swift/blob/e210320a59ddc2c6c627875fa3c655676c4d8ed1/stdlib/public/core/UTF8EncodingError.swift","https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-evolution/blob/ce9046a032217b9bdc3f98d46efa5c6230be7b75/proposals/0464-utf8span-safe-utf8-processing.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0884.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0884","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0884.rules","https://github.com/OWASP/www-community/blob/afb635859c1e17cdab241e1911232ccf2eefc109/pages/attacks/Unicode_Encoding.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/82b999fd586a119c783ecf948fd0f054f9999298/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0884.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0884.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0649.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0695","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0695.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0955","title":"Cisco Virtual Central Office 4000 远程用户名和密码泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco VCO/4K 5.1.3 存在远程用户名和密码检索漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标设备发送特制请求，利用该漏洞可远程获取系统存储的用户名和密码等敏感凭据信息，进而获得设备管理权限，可能导致整个通信网络被控制。该漏洞影响 Cisco VCO/4K 5.1.3 版本，Exploit-DB 已公开利用代码，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0955"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即限制 SNMP 访问来源，在 VCO/4K 上配置 ACL 仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问 SNMP（161/UDP），并将 SNMP community string 改为复杂随机字符串（≥20 位含大小写字母数字特殊字符）。同时禁用 SNMP v1/v2c，改用 SNMP v3 并启用加密认证。由于该产品已停止支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的替代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0955","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2000/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0955.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0955.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0695.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0692","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0692.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0949","title":"劳伦斯伯克利实验室 Traceroute 堆缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"LBNL Traceroute 1.4a5 及更早版本的 savestr 函数存在堆溢出漏洞。该工具因使用原始套接字通常以 setuid root 权限安装，攻击者可通过向 traceroute 传递特制的 \"-g\" 参数触发漏洞：savestr 函数使用预分配内存而非动态分配，第一次调用后指针被释放，第二次调用时用户数据被写入未分配内存区域，随后 free() 操作在无效的 malloc 头部上执行。本地攻击者可精心构造恶意 malloc 头部数据，利用堆内存破坏覆盖函数指针等关键内存区域，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 等多平台系统，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0949"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 LBNL traceroute 至 1.4a6 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Debian 安装 20001013 安全更新，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2000:078 更新，Caldera 安装 CSSA-2000-034.0 补丁，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2000:053 更新，TurboLinux 安装 2000-10-25 安全公告对应补丁。如无法升级，移除 traceroute 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20252","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0949","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2000/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0949.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0949.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0692.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0676","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0676.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0924","title":"Armada Design Master Index 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Armada Design Master Index 1.0 的 search.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 catigory 参数中注入 \"../\" 路径遍历序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件）。该漏洞影响 Armada Master Index 所有版本，已有公开的 Exploit-DB PoC 利用代码，对系统机密性构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0924"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-12-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即删除或禁用 `/cgi-bin/search/search.cgi` 脚本，或通过 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 访问该路径。同时可在 `search.cgi` 中对 `catigory` 参数做路径规范化过滤，拒绝包含 `../` 的输入。作为替代方案，可迁移至其他仍在维护的搜索程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20277","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0924","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0924.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0924.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0676.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0940","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0940.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1212","title":"Zope 2.2.4 Image和File对象数据更新方法权限保护不当漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.0 至 2.2.4 版本中存在权限提升漏洞，由于对 Image 和 File 对象的数据更新方法保护不充分，拥有 DTML 编辑权限的攻击者可利用该漏洞修改这些对象的原始数据，导致数据完整性受损。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，攻击复杂度低，但需要具备 DTML 编辑权限。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1212"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zope 至 2.2.5 或更高版本；如无法升级，安装 Zope 官方 2000-12-18 发布的安全热修复补丁。Debian 用户应用 DSA-007 更新，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:135 提供的更新包。同时严格限制 DTML 编辑权限，仅授予可信用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000365","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:086","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-007","http://www.osvdb.org/6283","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-135.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2000-12-18/security_alert","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5778","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1212","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-1212.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d6ca921ab16ef1f62d93ae6c66f1b85dd0b881a9/2000/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1212.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d4