e/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1211.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d6ca921ab16ef1f62d93ae6c66f1b85dd0b881a9/2000/CVE-2000-1211.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fb4a6b1b054a1fd4a892f5260545dddbd2342f5a/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1211.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1211.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1211.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0939.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1989","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1989.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1077","title":"iPlanet Web Server SHTML 日志记录缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"iPlanet Web Server 4.x 的 SHTML 日志记录功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器提交包含超长文件名的 .shtml 文件请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 iPlanet Web Server 4.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，且无需用户交互，可完全控制目标服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1077"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 iPlanet Web Server 4.x，官方已不再提供安全更新。建议升级到 Oracle iPlanet Web Server 7.x 或更高版本，或迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器产品。如无法升级，应在网络层面限制对服务器的未授权访问，并禁用 SHTML 日志记录功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5446","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1077.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1077","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob