E-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1076","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2000/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1076.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1076.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1076.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1988.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1988.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1987","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1987.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1071","title":"Apple iCal GUI 安装权限提升漏洞","description":"iCal 2.1 Patch 2 图形界面安装程序在安装过程中使用 \"xhost +\" 命令禁用了 X 服务器的访问控制机制，导致任何远程主机均可无限制连接到该 X 服务器。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络连接到目标系统的 X 服务，捕获并监控用户的所有 X Window 事件（包括键盘输入、屏幕显示内容等），进而获取与授权用户相当的系统权限。该漏洞影响安装了 iCal 2.1 Patch 2 的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击条件宽松且利用过程对用户透明。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1071"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"安装 Sun Microsystems 发布的安全更新，将 iCal 升级至 2.1 Patch 3 或更高版本以修复安装脚本中 xhost + 命令的问题。如无法立即升级，应在安装前编辑安装脚本，移除所有 xhost + 调用并改用 xauth 进行 X 服务器认证，同时通过 xhost - 恢复访问控制或配置防火墙仅允许本地 X11 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100900-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7213","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1767","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5752","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1071","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2000/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/22b1a4be43e1ee76195d2510f5edf079a15013bd/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1071.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1071.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1071.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1987.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1986","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1986.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1068","title":"Poll It poll_it_pro 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Poll It 2.0 投票 CGI 脚本存在远程命令执行漏洞，其 pollit.cgi 中的 poll_options 参数未经过滤即被传入 Perl 的 open() 函数。由于 open() 调用时未对 $poll_options 变量使用文件重定向符，攻击者可在参数值中插入管道符（|）等 shell 元字符，从而在 Web 服务器上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响所有使用 Poll It 2.0 的网站，攻击者无需事先获取管理密码即可利用。攻击者可通过构造类似 action=add_option&add_option=1&poll_options=echo+内容 的恶意 CGI 请求触发漏洞，实现网页篡改、文件写入或敏感信息窃取。攻击者在野已被广泛利用进行网站页面篡改，同时该版本还存在信息泄露问题，投票者 IP 地址可通过 pollit_files/ips.txt 被直接下载获取。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1068"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05Z","remediation":"升级到 Poll It 2.01 或更高版本，该版本将 ReadForm 函数调用移至变量声明之前，防止 CGI 输入覆盖 poll_options 等内部变量，从而阻断 shell 元字符注入路径。如厂商已停止维护且无法升级，建议立即删除 pollit.cgi 脚本，或在 Web 服务器配置中通过访问控制列表限制该脚本仅允许本地访问，同时在防火墙或 WAF 规则中过滤 poll_options 参数中的管道符（|）、分号（;）、反引号（`）及美元符号（$）等 shell 元字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236719315352&w=2","http://www.cgi-world.com/pollit.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5792","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1068","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2000/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1068.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1068.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1068.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1986.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1986.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1986.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1985","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1985.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1055","title":"Cisco CiscoSecure ACS Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CiscoSecure ACS Server 2.4(2) 及更早版本在处理 TACACS+ 协议数据包时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的超大 TACACS+ 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致服务拒绝，并可能进一步执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制受影响设备。该漏洞影响部署 CiscoSecure ACS Server 的网络设备，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1055"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"将 CiscoSecure ACS Server 从 2.4(2) 及更早版本升级到 2.4(3) 或更高版本，该版本修复了 TACACS+ 数据包处理中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或路由器上配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许受信任的 TACACS+ 客户端源 IP 访问服务器的 UDP/TCP 49 端口，作为临时缓解措施。升级后请重启 CiscoSecure ACS 服务并验证 TACACS+ 认证功能正常运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/csecureacsnt-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1569","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1706","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5273","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1055.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1055.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1055","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1055.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1055.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1055.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1055.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2000/CVE-2000-1055.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1055.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1985.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1984","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1984.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1047","title":"IBM Lotus Domino SMTP 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>Lotus Domino 5.0.4 及更早版本的 SMTP 邮件服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。攻击者通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 ENVID 关键字的\"MAIL FROM\"命令即可触发溢出，导致服务拒绝服务并可能执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Domino 邮件服务器系统，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1047"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lotus Domino 至 5.0.5 或更高版本（如 5.0.12、6.0.1 等），修复 SMTP 服务缓冲区溢出。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制仅受信 IP 访问 25 端口，或在 Domino 配置中禁用 SMTP 服务的 ENVID 关键字支持（在 notes.ini 中设置 SMTPDisableEnvid=1），并启用入侵检测系统监控异常 MAIL FROM 命令长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/442","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143071","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1905","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5488","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1047","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2000/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/dac938c9caec155f79e9c8bb28e43accc9c69f2f/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1047.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1047.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1047.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1984.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1983","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1983.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1044","title":"SuSE ypbind-mt 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 发行版中的 ypbind-mt（多线程 NIS/黄页绑定守护进程）存在格式化字符串漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理客户端请求时，将未经净化的用户可控数据直接作为格式化字符串参数传递给 printf 系列函数，攻击者可通过注入 %n、%x 等格式化字符串序列覆写内存数据并劫持程序执行流程。未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需向目标主机的 ypbind-mt 服务发送特制网络数据包即可触发该漏洞，进而在系统权限上下文中执行任意代码，最终获得 root 权限并完全控制受影响主机。该漏洞影响 SuSE 6.2 及其他部分 Linux 操作系统版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1044"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"建议升级 SuSE Linux 到 7.0 及以上版本，或安装 SuSE 官方发布的 ypbind-mt 修补补丁（ftp://ftp.suse.com/pub/suse/i386/update/6.2/rpm/ypbind-mt-1.14-13.i386.rpm）。若无法立即升级，请停用 ypbind 服务（/etc/init.d/ypbind stop 并 chkconfig ypbind off），并在防火墙层面封锁 111/TCP/UDP 端口（rpcbind/portmap）防止远程攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0262.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1820","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5394","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1044","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3979a7633898f20f850131e08d621fa27d545855/2000/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1044.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1044.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1044.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1983.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1982","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1982.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1043","title":"Mandrake Linux ypserv 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"Mandrake Linux 7.1 及更早版本中的 ypserv（网络信息服务守护进程）存在格式化字符串漏洞。当 ypserv 在未链接 vsyslog() 函数的情况下编译时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该服务发送包含格式化字符串特数的恶意输入，触发内存写入操作，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 7.1 及更早版本，以及可能其他未正确编译 ypserv 的 Linux 发行版。由于 ypserv 通常以 root 权限运行，攻击者可借此完全控制目标系统。攻击者无需任何凭据即可远程利用此漏洞，攻击复杂度低，危害极为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1043"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Mandrake Linux 7.1 的 ypserv 软件包至 Mandrake Security Advisory MDKSA-2000-064 发布的修复版本，或升级至 Mandrake Linux 7.2 及更高版本。临时缓解措施：通过 /etc/rc.d/init.d/ypserv stop 或 chkconfig ypserv off 禁用 ypserv 服务，并关闭防火墙对 TCP 111 端口和 ypserv 相关端口的入站访问。同时确认 ypserv 在编译时已启用 vsyslog() 函数支持，避免格式化字符串被攻击者利用提权至 root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-064.php3?dis=7.1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5731","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1043","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2000/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1043.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1043.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1043.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://gi